  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: \\(\\sin \\theta+\\cos \\theta=\\frac{b}{a}\\)\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\sin \\theta \\cdot \\cos \\theta=\\frac{c}{a} \\\\\n& \\left(\\frac{b}{a}\\right)^2=1+\\frac{2 c}{a} \\\\\n& b^2=a^2+2 a c \\\\\n& a^2-b^2+2 a c=0\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
